OL,3,ASouth Korea jails care home head for
OL,4,Asexually assaulting disabled residents
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe case has prompted the government to
OL,7,Finspect 1,507 care facilities for
OL,8,Fdisabled people across the country,
OL,9,Fwhere 33 cases of suspected abuse were
OL,10,Ffound.
